{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44783","headline":"题醴陵玉仙观歌 · 护国","name":"题醴陵玉仙观歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王乔一去空仙观，白云至今凝不散。\n星垣松殿几千秋，往往笙歌天下半。\n瀑布西行过石桥，黄精采根还采苗。\n路逢一人擎药椀，松花夜雨风吹满。\n自言家住在东坡，白犬相随邀我过。\n南山石上有棊局，曾使樵夫烂斧柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"护国","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}